 "final_message": "I recorded your intent to proceed with Brightpath, sent the documents they asked for, and answered both underwriting conditions. The application (BHL-26001) is now in underwriting, and both conditions show \"response received\". The lender hasn't cleared them yet.\n\n- **Loan Estimate:** It's within all your limits, so I accepted. The rate is 7.25% (limit 7.5%). The monthly payment is $3,485.58 (limit $3,600). Closing costs are $13,200 (limit $14,500).\n- **Documents:** I submitted the 14 records you had authorized: your four account statements sets, plus payslips and W-2s from PeoplePay. I did not share the business account.\n- **Deposit condition:** Sam said the $8,000 deposit on 09/03 into Sam's Juniper checking was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment. I sent that to the lender as the written explanation.\n- **W-2 condition:** I couldn't fetch the W-2s again because each PeoplePay token allows only 3 records, and those were already used. I told the lender the 2025 W-2s were in the records already delivered and pointed to those references. I couldn't confirm which of those six PeoplePay records are the W-2s, so the lender may come back asking for them.",
